Oracle: "Something meditative about memory and time."
Cluster A — "Reflective Memory Dramas" (relevance 0.71): Wild Strawberries, After Life, The Tree of Life, 45 Years, Aftersun
Cluster B — "Sci-fi Time Loops" (relevance 0.18): Primer, Looper, Source Code, Edge of Tomorrow, About Time
Entropy: 0.18.

